      "desc": "When triggering a <color=#FFFFFF>Perfect Dodge</color> or activating a <color=#FFFFFF>Defensive Assist</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>Passion Stream</color> is <color=#2BAD00>greatly increased</color>, replacing the <color=#FFFFFF>Passion</color> state with the <color=#FFFFFF>Overload Passion</color> state. In this state, Jane's <color=#2BAD00>ATK is additionally increased by 35%</color>. <color=#FFFFFF>Passion Stream</color> will automatically decrease over time, and hitting enemies with attacks <color=#2BAD00>no longer consumes</color> <color=#FFFFFF>Passion Stream</color>.",
